      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2014 Royal College of Physicians.",
        "AbstractText": "We describe the case of a young female presenting with myalgia, mildly raised creatine kinase and a rash. The discussion emphasises the importance of a systematic approach to muscle symptoms, the value of a detailed hand examination and the importance of magnetic resonance imaging in the investigation of muscular symptoms."
